<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/learning-experience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An event associated with learning, broadly interpreted to include formal and informal experiences such as courses, reading, field experiences, self-directed work, or receiving a certificate." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/learning-experience/versions/1> .
